<p>"Comparison gauges" KPI indicator. Each KPI is a goal-oriented progress bar — <strong>label · value</strong> on top, <strong>bar with a target tick</strong> in the middle, <strong>0 · tgt</strong> scale below. Bar fill is value/target, capped at 100% (overshoots are signalled by colour, not by overflowing the bar). Colours: <code>--pa-positive</code> for "on track", new <code>--pa-warning</code> for "off-target / approaching limit", <code>--pa-neutral</code> for "no strong sentiment".</p>



